  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>cabozantinib</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>L01EX07</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, oral dosing <small>(PK_1C_enteral)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Miles D et al. 2016</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>patients with medullary thyroid carcinoma</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>cabozantinib</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_cabozantinib/Cabozantinib_Miles2016v2_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>CL/F (males)</td><td>106</td><td>L/day</td><td><small>CL/F</small></td></tr><tr><td>V c/F</td><td>349</td><td>L</td><td><small>V/F</small></td></tr><tr><td>Ka</td><td>3.39</td><td>h−1</td><td><small>kabs</small></td></tr></table><h4>About cabozantinib</h4><p>Cabozantinib is a protein kinase inhibitor used to treat cancers such as renal cell carcinoma and medullary thyroid cancer. It is authorised in the European Union for thyroid, kidney, and liver cancers and is used in cancer care.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q795057\">Wikidata Q795057</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Cabozantinib\">Cabozantinib</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Miles D et al. (2016). Population Pharmacokinetic Model of Cabozantinib in Patients with Medullary Thyroid Carcinoma and Its Application to an Exposure-Response Analysis. <i>Clinical pharmacokinetics 55(1):93–105</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s40262-015-0295-x\">10.1007/s40262-015-0295-x</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26149244\">26149244</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Miles_2016_2: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
